    "axis": "aesthetics",
    "evidence": "Strong cyber-editorial identity, disciplined cyan/red palette, bold hero typography, and clear selected states across all viewports. Below demo-ready polish: desktop’s first vector column is visibly clipped on the left; tablet/mobile become very tall and text-dense with excessive empty space in the stage rail; several labels and JSON lines are tiny or truncated; and the global header feels cramped at smaller widths, including the visibly cut “LIVE WI” label. The desktop header’s oversized ghost lettering also competes with navigation.",
